#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:website_access_control.action_website_access_rule
msgid ""
"<b>Allow</b> rules let an IP, a network or a country through even inside a blocked region,\n"
"                e.g. the office internet connection. <b>Block</b> rules block an IP, a network or a country\n"
"                that is not covered by the blocked regions."
msgstr ""
"<b>放行</b>规则让某个 IP、网段或国家即使在拦截地区内也能访问，例如公司办公网络的出口 IP。<b>拦截</b>规则用于拦截拦截地区以外的 "
"IP、网段或国家，例如某个同行的出口 IP。"

