#. module: website_access_control
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_access_control.field_website_access_config__real_ip_header
msgid ""
"HTTP header carrying the visitor IP when the website is behind a CDN or "
"proxy, e.g. Ali-CDN-Real-IP for Alibaba Cloud CDN. Prefer a header the CDN "
"overwrites on every request (Ali-CDN-Real-IP, X-Real-IP, CF-Connecting-IP). "
"When the header holds several addresses, the rightmost public one is used, "
"because a visitor can forge the left part of X-Forwarded-For. The header is "
"only read on requests coming from a Trusted Proxy. Leave empty to use the "
"connection address, as corrected by proxy_mode."
msgstr ""
"网站在 CDN 或代理后面时，携带访客真实 IP 的请求头，阿里云 CDN 填 Ali-CDN-Real-IP。优先使用 CDN "
"每次都会覆盖写入的头(Ali-CDN-Real-IP、X-Real-IP、CF-Connecting-"
"IP)。请求头里有多个地址时取最右侧的公网地址，因为 X-Forwarded-For 左侧的内容访客可以伪造。只有来自“受信任代理”的请求才会读取该请求头。留空则使用连接地址(启用 "
"proxy_mode 时为其修正后的地址)。"

