#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_access_control.field_website_access_config__exempt_paths
msgid ""
"One path per line (e.g. /shop/payment/webhook). Requests to these paths and "
"their sub-paths are never blocked, in addition to the login page, backend, "
"portal and payment callbacks."
msgstr ""
"每行一个路径(例如 /shop/payment/webhook)。这些路径及其子路径永远不拦截；登录页、后台、门户和支付回调已默认豁免，无需填写。"

#. module: website_access_control
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_access_control.website_access_config_view_form
msgid ""
"Open this page through the public domain and check that \"Your IP As Seen\" is your real\n"
"                                public IP, not the address of the CDN, before switching to Block mode.\n"
"                                Make sure as well that the server only accepts connections from the CDN."
msgstr "切换到“拦截”模式前，请通过正式域名打开本页面，确认“识别到的你的 IP”是你真实的公网 IP，而不是 CDN 节点的地址。同时请确保服务器只接受来自 CDN 的连接。"

#. module: website_access_control
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:website_access_control.field_website_access_config__real_ip_header
msgid "Real IP Header"
msgstr "真实 IP 请求头"

#. module: website_access_control
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_access_control.website_access_config_view_form
msgid "One CDN back-to-origin address or network per line"
msgstr "每行一个 CDN 回源地址或网段"

#. module: website_access_control
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_access_control.website_access_config_view_form
msgid ""
"The Real IP Header is ignored until Trusted Proxies is filled in: add the\n"
"                                addresses the CDN connects from (see \"Connection Address\" below)."
msgstr "填写“受信任代理”之前，真实 IP 请求头不会生效：请填入 CDN 回源连接使用的地址(参见下方的“连接地址”)。"

#. module: website_access_control
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:website_access_control.field_website_access_config__trusted_proxies
msgid "Trusted Proxies"
msgstr "受信任代理"

#. module: website_access_control
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_access_control.field_website_access_config__trusted_proxies
msgid ""
"Addresses or networks (CIDR) of the CDN or proxy that connects to Odoo, one "
"per line, e.g. the back-to-origin ranges of the CDN. The Real IP Header is "
"only read on requests whose Connection Address is in this list: anyone else "
"reaching the server directly could put any address in that header. When "
"empty, the header is ignored."
msgstr ""
"连接到 Odoo 的 CDN 或代理的地址或网段(CIDR)，每行一个，例如 CDN 的回源 IP 段。只有“连接地址”在此列表中的请求才会读取真实 IP "
"请求头：其他直接访问服务器的人可以在该请求头里随意填写地址。留空则忽略该请求头。"

